  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now you can ad a max of 3 languages and 3 links to your profile even though there would be space to add 4 of them. This results in there always being one empty slot to the right of your languages and links.\n# Suggestion:\nAllow us to add a max of 4 languages and links, there is already space for them in the Menu and it would allow people who speak multiple languages to add another one, as well as allow use to link to more of our websites.\n# Attachments:\nHere you can see that it maxes out at 3 while there is still space for a 4th one:",
